  <item>
    <title>44 考研女孩|考研调剂上岸指南</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69c7d9d7b977fb2c47757984</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69c7d9d7b977fb2c47757984</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 28 Mar 2026 13:42:19 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="15">00:15</a> 心态调整: 重新定义调剂；放弃名校、完美执念；用行动打败焦虑</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="120">02:00</a>三种调剂情况详解：①A区调A区；②A区调B区；③全日制调非全</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="270">04:30</a>调剂全流程第一步——择校①官方渠道；②非官方渠道（小红书、微信群)等;③择校策略</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="540">09:00</a>调剂全流程第二步——预报名,提前填写意向学校</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="720">12:00</a>调剂全流程第三步——正式报名与确认</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="870">14:30</a>调剂全流程第四步——复试准备之准备材料</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="960">16:00</a>调剂全流程第四步——复试准备之内容与表现</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1140">19:00</a>调剂失败后的规划：二战or直接工作</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1350">22:30</a>调剂全程核心注意事项：①时刻关注研招网/学信网；②手机保持开机；③复试前反复检查材料</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1440">24:00</a>星光不问赶路人，时光不负有心人</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkUxxGnWk-_uxeF7vzajzE5vj6j5.png"></figure>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/65b64296272cda5ea44c6749/luJgVeMzFWLKSZD9EBZqN8REDG48.m4a" length="35479726" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:36:31</itunes:duration>
