  <item>
    <title>43 旅游，春天最重要的是走出门！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69c294e4798af9b984ebbcf2</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69c294e4798af9b984ebbcf2</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 24 Mar 2026 13:46:17 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">0:00</a>去过的地方，还想再去一次的地方是西双版纳</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="180">03:00</a>我的这些旅游规划：地点、预算、旅行次数</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="295">04:55</a>旅行建议规划</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="340">05:40</a> 旅游，需要旅游搭子吗?踏上路，自会有人同行</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="495">08:15</a> 旅行只需要找一个能让自己出门的理由，要有独自出发的勇气</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="562">09:22</a>旅游旅的是什么?体验派、颜值派、历史派</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="643">10:43</a>什么是一次完美的旅行?</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="773">12:53</a>乌海一日游，独享沙漠的秋千</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="914">15:14</a>下一次独自旅游，多跟陌生人交流，多了解历史</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="985">16:25</a>新疆，广西，都要见证朋友的感情</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1057">17:37</a> 并不是每个人都需要从旅游中获得能量，各自有各自的活法</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1160">19:20</a>高敏感就适合去看世界,去爬山，去看海，去追赶日落等待日出</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lkwe_9FUB6hFNCZw2npJq4YL9lwr.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmNiNxcU576o7kgZ5CBIWtLVNpj6.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/ll4vBKMmus0T7eBnT59b5BVev5Wf.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqSBLMh986QPQ_ON9rc6qgggYq40.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/65b64296272cda5ea44c6749/lmnEU1KYZ2soCHiRgNB4vJPppbP6.m4a" length="20499440" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:21:06</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjcMUWGMFqifuSyC-CnfMxME-KsA.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>42 同居磨合期，沟通怎么这么难！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69b2879384bce022f9190a6c</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69b2879384bce022f9190a6c</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 14 Mar 2026 13:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 我跟男朋友相恋十年，同居5个月，在过年期间问题大爆发</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="132">02:12</a> 今年过年，你要不要来我家？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="289">04:49</a> 我要不要主动洗碗，表现自己的勤劳？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="387">06:27</a> 第一次平静地面对你与我相悖的想法</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="508">08:28</a> 一直问问问，你到底想不想买！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="660">11:00</a> 《换乘恋爱4》敏京和有植，为什么会沟通失败？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="812">13:32</a> 抱着这两种想法沟通，彻底完蛋！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="986">16:26</a> 反方在天堂寻找尘埃，而正方在地狱里乘着摇椅享受地狱之火的温暖</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1192">19:52</a> 沟通不能解决所有的问题，没定论就是定论</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1294">21:34</a> 人，只有自己才能给自己快乐，自己给自己疗伤。</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/65b64296272cda5ea44c6749/lm4w2hzPiwVqnck1y3hhKDL6mN15.m4a" length="22064279" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:22:43</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fke12KNVpXWv9fD9o8qz1VvfGpAP.png"/>
